{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-2","storyName":"糖瓜粘","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"经过推理，惊蛰找到了两桩旧案最直接的相关者——退休的礼部尚书宁述。而在同一天，身为玉门参知的梁洵也出现在了宁府。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["宁辞秋","慈祥的老人","宁述","宁府管家","宁府杂役","不善言辞的男子","？？？","梁洵","煌","古玩店老板","行箸","麟青砚"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_animal_loop","volume":"1","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"秋高气爽。","id":9},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":10,"musicid":0},{"type":"text","text":"庭院幽静，长长的院墙将主人与外面的喧嚣隔得很远。只有一棵老柿子树斜倚在院墙阴凉处，苍老的树冠越过了墙头。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"没有人知道老树见过什么，只知道从这棵树在这深院中种下，春去秋来过几回，它便红过几回。","id":12},{"type":"text","text":"枝头的柿子红得发透，是年复一年的新鲜。往年摘下的果子、埋在泥中的叶，都算不上与现在有关。","id":13},{"type":"text","text":"老人就坐在树下，趁着树荫酣睡。","id":14},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","duration":"1.5","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"......爷爷。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慈祥的老人","text":"......","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#4$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"爷爷？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慈祥的老人","text":"......","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慈祥的老人","text":"呼......嗯......","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.5","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慈祥的老人","text":"辞秋啊......回来啦？","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"嗯......路上耽误了一点时间，总算赶在中秋节前回来啦。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慈祥的老人","text":"唉......前阵子我就天天惦记着，看着这柿子一天比一天红，就想你再不回来呀，今年的柿子都吃不到了。","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#5$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慈祥的老人","text":"也不知道，我还能看这柿子树挂几次果，你要是再回来晚一点呀，可能就连我这把老骨头都见不到咯。","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#8$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"爷爷......","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":40},{"type":"text","text":"宁辞秋将说惯了的玩笑话咽了回去，她看着身边的老人，将他和自己离开前记下的模样细细比照。老人眯起的眼角似乎又多了几道皱纹。","id":41},{"type":"text","text":"秋风乍起，像是顽童攀上老人膝头，将老人理好的花白须发拨弄得散乱。","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"大荒城第一个移动地块的试运行工作，到上个月才算完工。礼部在那边的工作算结束了，这才给我批了半个月的假。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"回来就好啊，这一趟，辛苦你了。","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"大荒城的事，我一早都听说了。批评的话，也都写在信里了。","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我知道救灾的时候你也出了力，但是保护百姓，是每一个炎国官员的本职。而作为礼部侍郎，这个监管不力的过错，你必须承担。","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"罚你半年俸禄，算是轻的，你不许有怨。","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"当然不会，这次的过错，我会牢牢放在心上。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"辞秋，你要记得，永远不要想自己做到了什么，而是要问自己没有做到什么。","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"身为百姓父母官，也身为人臣，上承君命，下受民禄，官无大小，肩上的责任都是千钧重。","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"何况你已经在这个位置上，做得再多，都是本分，但凡有些许责任没能尽到，那就是天大的过错。","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"要是没有这样的觉悟，就穿不起这身赤色官服。","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#1$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"“鞠躬尽瘁，如是而已。”爷爷过去的教导，我都记得。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"这次的过错固然要放在心上，可若因此产生了放弃的想法，那才是真的对不起自己的职责。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"嗯......","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"行啦，教训的话就说到这。不在其位，不谋其事，礼部的事，我到底是管不着了。","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我现在就是担心，孙女的伤怎么样了。","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"早都已经康复啦，爷爷，您就别操心了。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"伤筋动骨一百天，大意不得。这两天安顿下来，有空还是上大夫那看看。前阵子正好有老同事给我送了几贴膏药，一会你也带点回去。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#9$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"好好，都听您的。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你们几个年轻人，没一个让人省心的。","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"眼看着马上要从这搬回老家了，我的儿子女儿也没空回来看一眼，你姐姐也一天到晚不着家，谁会记挂我这个老头子？","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"呵呵，您说姐姐贪玩我信，可您要说没人记挂您......我看您这两天闭门谢客，应该也不是无缘无故吧？","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哼，还提呢！现在这些小年轻，从来就不知道心思该放在哪。","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"从上个月起，从早到晚，这院子里就不能清闲一刻。","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"现在这些年轻人都还学精了，不敢明着送茶送酒，就盯着给我的花浇水。我那门口好不容易种的绣球呀，都给我浇死好几盆了！","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"噗......","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"这阵子您的客人这么多，我猜，是尚书大人带着草拟的百珍宴宴请名单来找您了吧。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"一年里难得能见到真龙，探听朝局消息的机会，肯定多的是人放在心上。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我都不想理那个小子，他才是现在的礼部尚书，这种事怎么还需要我拿主意？","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"谁让您为官几十载，在礼部留下那么多功绩，威望比谁都高呢？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"那也是过去的事了，老看着过去，后来人还怎么做事？","id":90},{"type":"charslot","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府管家","text":"宁大人，门外有客人。","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"不是说了闭门谢客吗......这位又是打哪来的？","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府管家","text":"客人说，他是玉门参知——","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#4$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"咦......？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"玉门参知？这倒是没听说过......","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"不管是什么官，不见，一概不见。","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#4$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"爷爷，请稍等一下。这位客人，好像是来找我的。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府杂役","text":"先生，宁大人最近几天闭门谢客，您还是改日再来吧。","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不善言辞的男子","text":"还是烦请再通报一下宁......宁大人，就说是一位老朋友来找她......","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府杂役","text":"先生，无意冒犯......可是看您的岁数，您确定是宁大人的“老朋友”？","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不善言辞的男子","text":"确实如此，在下不敢妄言......","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府杂役","text":"先生，您还是回去吧。宁大人实在不方便见客，作为“老朋友”，您也别让他为难了......","id":115},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"梁大人......？","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不善言辞的男子","text":"——！","id":121},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#4$1","duration":"0.5","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"不认识我了？","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#8$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"宁小姐......好久不见......","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"听说......听说你刚刚回到百灶，我想......来见见你。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"梁洵的目光落在了宁小姐的身后，那儿正站着一位慈眉善目的老人。","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"别站着啦，辞秋啊，快招呼你的朋友进来坐啊。","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"这......","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":137},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":141},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_bg_25_g11_yanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":144},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":145,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#1$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"......","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"咦，怎么都不动筷子？","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈，看来是我这个老头子打扰了你们年轻人的兴致。要不，我先回避？你们慢慢吃，慢慢聊。","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#4$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"岂敢！是晚辈贸然叨扰，前辈设宴款待，我怎敢——","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"爷爷，您就别吓唬他了。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈哈......梁洵小友，就不必客气了。","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"辞秋还在尚蜀的时候就常常来信，说那里的知府是体恤百姓又有才学的俊杰，今天终于得以一见。","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#4$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"爷爷，我什么时候——","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈哈......三天后，是老朽的生日，本来不想大费周章地操办。","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"今天我就自作主张一回，留你们两个年轻人陪我吃顿饭、说说话，就算给我庆寿了。","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#8$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"晚辈恭祝前辈寿辰。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"我也祝爷爷海屋添筹。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"都是自家人，客气什么。来来来，吃菜吃菜。","id":170},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"charslot","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pickupchopsticks","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我原先记得，梁洵小友是在尚蜀担任知府，可方才怎么又说，你是玉门参知？","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"从玉门到百灶，你这大老远过来，是所为何事呀？","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"玉门此行路途遥远，先前已按计划，将城中百姓分批次安置在沿途各个移动城市中。最后一拨百姓，前几天也已经在百灶城中安顿下来。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#4$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"咦，那玉门不是在西北边巡防，怎么绕到百灶边上来了？","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"爷爷您忘啦？今年年初的时候，玉门就已经改变航道出发前往百灶了。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"至于玉门为什么要赶回百灶，爷爷总记得吧？","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"唉......又是这个老大难的问题。","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"吵了这么多年也没吵出名堂。退休这么久了，有时候做梦，脑子里都是那几个大嗓门的声音，头疼。","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"是上千年的问题了。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#8$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"唔，有些问题拖久了也就不是问题了，有些则变成了更大的问题。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#1$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"现在总算是到不得不解决的时候了......爷爷，您的主意呢？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我能有什么主意，我要是再有主意，该有人说我指手画脚咯。","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"我看可未必吧，尚书大人他不是三天两头往您这跑，他就没有和您聊起这件事？","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#5$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"宁小姐......有些事，宁大人不方便讲的。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈哈哈......瞧我这孙女，倒是学会替别人问话了。","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"却也无妨。老朽本就是普通百姓，不知道什么不能说的朝廷秘辛，自然也没有不能说的话。只是这件事上，反倒要请教一下年轻人。","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"梁洵小友，你的意思呢？","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"晚辈不敢妄言全局，但是相信一个粗浅的道理——","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"上兵伐谋。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"一场战争，于朝廷而言，有弊无利；于百姓而言，只有家破人亡。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"上兵伐谋......说得不错。","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"可是，按这个说法......千年前要是没有那位真龙的狩猎之举，又何来之后炎国的千年国祚呢？","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"世殊事异，情况不可尽同日而语。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"千年前的战争名为围猎，可实际则是人从无法匹敌的“神明”手中夺来活路，稍有退让，即是放弃了最后一点赖以生存的立锥之地。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"但时至今日，攻守势异。既然已经掌握主动，不思避免战事，还要让将士百姓罹受战乱之苦，那便是我辈无能了。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈哈哈，说得好极了。听了梁洵小友这一番高论，想到自己碌碌无为，老朽都要脸红了。","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"晚辈妄言！还请前辈不要怪罪......","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"嗯，善战者无赫赫之功......梁洵小友既然有这般主张，想来也一定有把控局势的妙手了。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"晚辈——","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府管家","text":"宁大人，外面又有人来访。","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"又是怎么回事......","id":230},{"type":"charslot","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁府管家","text":"来的人说，她是大理寺少卿，有要紧的事想询问您，并非无事拜访。","id":232},{"type":"charslot","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#1$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"大理寺......？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"看来这位客人，是不得不见的。","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"实在不好意思，老朽要失陪了。","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"辞秋啊，代我照顾好客人。","id":239},{"type":"dialog","id":240},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkingstick_slow","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#9$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"刚才管家说的客人......该不会是麟少卿吧？","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#1$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"你也认识麟少卿？","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"与天师府打交道，多少有点耳闻。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#8$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"我也听说过，青雷伯白定山是她的师伯，麟少卿雷法造诣非凡，办案也是雷霆手段。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"就是不知道，她找爷爷有什么事呢......","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":253},{"type":"dialog","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":257},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_35_g13_yanlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":260},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":261},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smashtable","volume":"0.5","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":263},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$sjoyasorrow_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_sjoyasorrow_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":264,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","duration":"0.5","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"麟青砚！你查你的案子，趁我睡觉时把我锁在房间里干什么？！","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我又不是三岁小孩！你凭什么限制我的人身自由！","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"放我出去！！！","id":270},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0.2","id":272},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":273},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smashtable","volume":"0.5","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"该死......都已经到和那位约好的时间了。又没有留她的联系方式，这可怎么办......","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":278},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"shake","power":"7","times":"50","duration":"0.5","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"不行......这个门拆了可就修不好了，万一被店家赶出去可就没地住了。","id":282},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":284},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":286},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这个窗户......","id":290},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.5","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"0.51","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bowl_smash","id":294},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.3","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"十八楼？也不是很高，跳吧！","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","duration":"0.5","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":302},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"jump","posto":"550,50","power":"0","times":"1","duration":"0.6","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":305},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.4","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"charslot","id":310},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":311},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古玩店老板","text":"姑娘，你已经在这站了半个时辰了，到底买不买啊。","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这位先生，我再问您一遍，这幅《春趣游园图》，真的是漱江先生真迹吗？","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古玩店老板","text":"姑娘，你出去随便打听打听，我这家店在古玩界的名声，我这双眼睛什么时候看走眼过？","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古玩店老板","text":"你看看这画的技法、神韵，如果不是漱江先生，还能有谁画得出来？","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#4$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"丹青之法，我的确算不上专精，可这幅画上有一个再明显不过的错误。","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"画中餐桌上的这种葡萄，是628年才第一次从高卢传入炎国的，可这画上的落款写的是580年，这要怎么解释？","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古玩店老板","text":"去去去，这都是哪和哪，掰扯了这么多，不就是想用便宜价格买我的画吗？","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古玩店老板","text":"你这种人我见多了，我警告你，再闹我可就要喊人了。","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#4$1","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这位先生，我本来就没打算买您店里的画，又何必与您在价格上争执？","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"再说，我刚才说的明明是随便哪个书阁都能查到的资料，也并非我一家之言啊。","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"您要是觉得我说得不对，您自己举证指出我的错误就好，您就算叫来全百灶的人，假的也变不成真的呀。","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古玩店老板","text":"不买你在这嚷嚷什么？！","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古玩店老板","text":"我告诉你，我卖的要是有半件假货，你就让老天砸了我这家店！","id":336},{"type":"dialog","id":337},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":338},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"0","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":340},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"0.5","id":341},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","id":343},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sundries","volume":"0.5","id":344},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,0","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这楼上怎么还装了雨棚......？","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐？你怎么——","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"哈......哈哈......我......","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#7$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我没迟到吧？","id":357},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":361},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_bg_25_g11_yanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":362},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":364},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":365,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":366},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"贵客久等了，最近老朽家里客人实在是多，还请见谅。","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"请问你是......？","id":369},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"charslot","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"晚辈麟青砚，现任大理寺少卿一职。今天贸然拜访，是想要向宁大人打听一些事。","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"咦......大理寺？好多年没打过交道了。老朽的确是老糊涂了，现在的大理寺卿是虞澄吗？","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"虞澄......大理寺卿？宁大人应该是记错了，虞少卿已经不在大理寺任职了。","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"对对，想起来了，确实是这么回事。好像青雷伯白定山有一位用雷法的徒弟，出了天师府去大理寺任职了，应该就是你吧。","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"听说白天师调回百灶有段时间了，也没来找我这个老头子吃顿饭喝喝茶，看来是没把我这个退休的老头子放在心上啦。","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"非常时期，想必天师府也是格外繁忙。下次见到师伯，我会和他提及此事......","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈，说远啦，麟少卿请坐，先用茶吧。","id":385},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":386},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"雅致的房间里，桌椅器具装饰摆设，无不精致。偏偏是正对着门的那面墙上，好像空出了一幅画的位置。","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"本应被画遮蔽的部分，此时与墙体其他地方形成了肉眼可见的色差。","id":389},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"宁大人雅兴，茶是好茶，这满屋物件也无不精致......可我看这房间，像是少了一幅画？","id":395},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"噢......你说那个呀，那是早些年别人送我的一幅寿翁图。","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"可老话不都说，老来生日过不得。到这个节骨眼，这些东西可算不得吉利。","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"没想到，宁大人也会相信这种迷信之说。","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"老来信命不自由，让麟少卿见笑了。","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"可我听说，宁大人家中的挂画，近来被贼人动了手脚。","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"饴糖封口，是民间传说。每逢过年，要用糖粘上“灶神”的嘴，让他多言好事，不提坏事。看来这贼人不仅胆大包天，而且别有用心。","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"家中遭遇了这种事，宁大人为何不报官？","id":407},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我既然没报官，麟少卿又如何得知我家里遭了贼？","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......有同事在办此案，我看过卷宗。但报案的似乎并不是宁府的人？","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"呵呵，一把年纪了，承蒙有人挂念。","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"没想到，麟少卿也会信这种民间传说？","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈哈哈......老朽不过是闲人，但麟少卿的时间应该相当宝贵吧。今天特意来找老朽，有什么事，就直接说吧。","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"晚辈今天到访，是想要和宁大人打听一个人。","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"不知宁大人还记不记得，顾筌？","id":421},{"type":"dialog","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"唔......","id":425},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"十年前，顾筌跟随炎国外交使团前往维多利亚，途中遭遇风雪天灾，他本人因失足坠入河中而死。","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这件事，宁大人可还记得？","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"记得，怎么不记得......","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"那应该是十二月，冬天的事吧。消息传回百灶的时候，就快要过年了......","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我还记得，回来的信使说，当时使团遇到暴风雪，被困在山里。顾筌留在队伍最后，他送别人一个个走过那段险路，自己却掉了下去......","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"唉，寒冬腊月，那河水该多冷哟......","id":433},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"看来宁大人对这件事也很上心。","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"顾筌啊......他在礼部的时候，一直勤勤恳恳，尽职尽责，不仅颇有文采，还写得一手好字。","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"可惜他也没有亲人，出了那场事故后，只在思贤陵留下了一座衣冠冢，礼部每年都会派人去扫墓照料......","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"没有亲人......？","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"说了这么多，麟少卿提起这个人，是想问什么？","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"外交使节因事故死于他国，属于重大外交事故。依炎律，要由两国派遣专员协同调查，并将结果层层审核，最终归档。","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"但是不知为何，顾筌死后，不仅礼部没有履行这样的流程，大理寺对这个案件的记录也颇为潦草。","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"老朽糊涂了，这明明是大理寺的问题，麟少卿怎么反而来问我一个礼部的人呢？","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"那我便提醒一下宁大人。","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"在使团出发前的两个月，顾筌只是一名普通的九品奉礼郎，为什么突然之间，变成了去往维多利亚的宣礼使？","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"在顾筌调令上签字的人，是当时身为礼部尚书的您吧。","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈哈哈......麟少卿的问题，我这才算听明白。","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你是说，是老朽特意安排顾筌出使外国，又用了手段将他害死。","id":454},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......在下并无此意。","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"事有蹊跷，晚辈只想将这些陈年疑案一一厘清，还望宁大人为晚辈解惑。","id":457},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"既然麟少卿都已经问了，那何不再问明白一点。","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你是不是还想说，老朽好歹也是一任尚书，为何要与一个九品的奉礼郎为难？莫不是，他抓住了老朽什么不为人知的把柄？","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"麟少卿想问的，恐怕不只是这十年前的旧案吧？","id":461},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":463},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哈哈......无妨无妨，但问无妨。","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"可是这同一个，明明已经有了答案的问题，再问上一百遍、一千遍，得到的也只会是同样的答案......","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"麟少卿，又想得到什么样的答案？","id":467},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......最真实的答案。","id":469},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"呵呵呵......老朽已经是半截入土的人了，还有什么好欺瞒的。","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"倒是麟少卿既然认为老朽嫌疑不小，又该如何相信老朽说的就是实话呢？","id":472},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我只想请宁大人告知，当年顾筌突然调迁的前因后果。其余的，在下自然会有判断。","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"好，好......有劳麟少卿亲自来跑一趟，我总要给你一个交代。","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"当年顾筌的调迁，的确事出有因。是他自己来求我的。","id":478},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"他自己的要求？","id":480},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"是啊，他说自己疾病缠身，恐怕时日无多，想要回到维多利亚的故居以终余年，于是，我就同意了他加入前往维多利亚的使团。","id":482},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......他得了什么病？","id":484},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":485},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"其中细节，我也不清楚了。只依稀记得，那阵子顾筌的确看上去精神不佳。","id":486},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"可是顾筌作为一个礼部最底层的文员，他应该连见您一面的机会都不多，又如何能直接向您求官？","id":488},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"说来惭愧......这里也有老朽一点私心。","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"因为顾筌写得一手好字，令人印象颇深，我偶尔劳烦他代我抄写一些书信，还请他给我家几个孩子教过一点书法。","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我念在这一点人情，想到他的请求也只是人之常情，又并非利欲之心，便答应了下来。","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"这就是顾筌当年调迁背后的事......麟少卿，还有问题吗？","id":493},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"既然宁大人亲自给了这个答案，在下便将这个答案收下了。","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"只是在下斗胆指出，前辈方才说错了一句话。","id":496},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哦？","id":498},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"且不论在下身为大理寺官员，就是任何一个堂堂正正的人，想要知道一个真相，都并不需要什么理由。","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"在下只为查明真相，别无他念，请宁大人放心。","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"晚辈告辞。","id":502},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"客人慢走，不送了。","id":504},{"type":"dialog","id":505},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":506},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":507},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":508},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":509},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":510},{"type":"charslot","id":511},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":512},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_bg_25_g11_yanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":513},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":514},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":515},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":516,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":517},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":518},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"咦，梁洵小友呢？","id":519},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":520},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"这都几点啦，我早让他回去了。","id":521,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"您还说呢。您专门把人家留下来吃饭，又把人家晾在那这么久，哪有这样的待客之道？","id":522,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"唉，怪我怪我，确实是失礼了。你替爷爷道个歉，让人家有空多来家里坐坐，下次我一定好好招待，好好赔罪。","id":524},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"放心吧，梁大人也不是不讲理的人，会体谅爷爷的。","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":527},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"对了......这位梁洵小友的名字，是哪个字呀？","id":528},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":529},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"洵，三点水旁加旬日的旬。","id":530,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","id":531},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哦......“自牧归荑，洵美且异”，的确是个好名字。","id":532},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我听说，名字里带三点水旁的人，都聪明。","id":533},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#10$1","id":534},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"也就只有您这么说了，别人都说他像块木头。","id":535,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":536},{"type":"text","text":"老人说着，若无其事地走到桌边，提起笔，在一张名单上添上了一个名字。","id":537},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","id":538},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"嗯......要说木讷，倒也算木讷。","id":539},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"大老远来见心上人，怎么带的尽是这些礼物......玉门的粗茶，还有这叫“烈刀子”的烈酒，怎么倒像是送我的？","id":540},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_298_1#8$1","id":541},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁辞秋","text":"......","id":542,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_298_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":543},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":544},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":545},{"type":"charslot","id":546},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":547},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":548},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":549},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":550},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"麟青砚，留步。","id":552},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":553,"musicid":5},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#16$1","id":554},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"谁？！","id":555},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":556},{"type":"text","text":"麟青砚极少有过这种感觉。","id":557},{"type":"text","text":"一个带剑的人，靠近自己周遭一丈之内，自己却毫无察觉。","id":558},{"type":"text","text":"直到这个人出现在自己面前。","id":559},{"type":"dialog","id":560},{"type":"charslot","id":561},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":562},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":563},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":564},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#10$1","id":565},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这身衣服......","id":566},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你是......禁军？","id":567},{"type":"dialog","id":568},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":569},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":570},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":571},{"type":"image","id":572},{"type":"charslot","id":573}],"characters":["宁辞秋","慈祥的老人","宁述","宁府管家","宁府杂役","不善言辞的男子","？？？","梁洵","煌","古玩店老板","行箸","麟青砚"]}